p=2, n=1: checked 1 lifts of 1; every additive order equals 2.
p=2, n=2: checked 2 lifts of 1; every additive order equals 4.
p=2, n=3: checked 4 lifts of 1; every additive order equals 8.
p=2, n=4: checked 8 lifts of 1; every additive order equals 16.
p=2, n=5: checked 16 lifts of 1; every additive order equals 32.
